<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Superior Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Superior Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds has downgraded its rating for Superior Industries International Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Van Nuys, Calif., manufacturer of automobile wheels closed on Friday at 25.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
